  "prompt": "Which result does this query return? The campaigns table holds these numbers of campaigns per channel: nonbrand_search 48 and brand_search 8 (channel_group paid_search); meta 48 and linkedin 18 (paid_social); affiliates 22 and review_sites 12 (paid_partner); youtube 24 (paid_video). The unpaid channels organic, direct and referral have no campaigns.",
